#, python-format
msgid ""
"This action will %(action)s %(boxes_count)d boxes to the default "
"configuration. All previous schemes will be lost!\n"
"\n"
"!!! THIS CHANGE IS IRREVERSIBLE !!!\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue? [y/N]: "
